# SPA fallback. Cloudflare Pages already serves index.html for unmatched paths
# on this project, so this file is not what makes /globe work today — it is here
# so the behaviour is declared in the build output rather than inherited from a
# project-level default. That matters for the planned cutover onto the existing
# `airlens` Pages project, where the deployed dist replaces the project's files
# wholesale: whatever is not in dist/ is gone.
#
# Note this returns the same 200 shell for paths that do not exist. Adding a
# real 404 requires per-route rendering, which this repo does not have yet.
/*  /index.html  200
